        "original_id": "fc73958c-4e7a-5bf2-837d-11e0c71dcb6f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dawn Lake, Bert Newton, Lucille Ball\n- Places: Australia\n- Roles: television comedian, singer, entertainer, actor\n- Products: I Love Lucy, The Lucy–Desi Comedy Hour, The Lucy Show, Here's Lucy, Life with Lucy\n\nFacts:\n- Dawn Lake was born on 20 January 1927 and died on 1 January 2006.\n- Dawn Lake was an Australian television comedian, singer, entertainer, and actor whose career lasted more than four decades.\n- Bert Newton described Dawn Lake as \"our greatest comedienne - Australia's Lucille Ball\".\n- Lucille Ball was best known as the star of the self-produced sitcoms I Love Lucy, The Lucy–Desi Comedy Hour, The Lucy Show, Here's Lucy, and Life with Lucy.",
